src/kak.rs contains code adapted from Qiskit 2.5.1:
  crates/synthesis/src/two_qubit_decompose/weyl_decomposition.rs
  crates/synthesis/src/two_qubit_decompose/basis_decomposer.rs

src/linalg.rs and src/recursion.rs adapt the Block-ZXZ/demultiplex formulas from:
  crates/synthesis/src/qsd.rs
  crates/synthesis/src/linalg/mod.rs
src/euler.rs adapts the U3/ZYZ parameter formulas from:
  crates/synthesis/src/euler_one_qubit_decomposer.rs

